<title>USA: South West Property completes Sierra Palms.</title>
<headline>South West Property completes Sierra Palms.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South West Property Trust Inc said Friday it had completed its 320-unit Sierra Palms apartment community in Chandler, Arizona.</p>
<p>It said it had leased 88 percent of the units in the community.</p>
<p>South West, an equity real estate investment trust, said it had leased 30 apartments a month at the community in 1996, 50 percent more than expected.</p>
<p>It said rental rates were averaging $0.81 per square foot per month, about 16 percent higher than it had forecast.</p>
</text>
